OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,6,Fwith some spells of sunshine, although
OL,7,Fsome cloud around at times. Feeling
OL,8,Fwarm in the sunshine. Light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,11,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,12,Fwith clear periods although clouding
OL,13,Fover the across the east later.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with the chance
OL,16,Fof a few showers, these mainly over
OL,17,Fthe hills. Best of the brightness
OL,18,Facross the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
